{"AlertRuleMenu gates menu rendering on rulerRule despite OR'ing prom/ruler abilities \u2014 Pause menu item requires rulerRule to be present, so if the view only has prom data (rulerRule is undefined), the pause menu item will not render even if grafanaPauseSupported && grafanaPauseAllowed are true": 0.44098103046417236, "AlertRuleMenu gates menu rendering on rulerRule despite OR'ing prom/ruler abilities \u2014 Delete menu item requires rulerRule to be present, so prom-only data will not allow delete to appear even if prom-based ability permits it": 0.34637847542762756, "useAllRulerRuleAbilities and useAllGrafanaPromRuleAbilities have divergent MaybeSupported semantics \u2014 ruler-based checks are conservative (dependent on isRulerAvailable) while prom-based checks are optimistic (AlwaysSupported)": 0.3297627866268158, "useAllRulerRuleAbilities and useAllGrafanaPromRuleAbilities have divergent silence handling implementations": 0.3781288266181946, "ctx.hasPermissionInMetadata existence and validity in useIsGrafanaPromRuleEditable needs investigation due to contradictory findings about whether the method exists": 0.29629001021385193, "GrafanaGroupLoader removed Ruler/merge logic and now only uses Prometheus response, potentially dropping ruler-only handling and losing visibility of rules in certain states": 0.613868772983551, "GrafanaGroupLoader removal of matchRules function that handled promOnlyRules and creating/deleting states may cause those cases to no longer be shown or be incorrectly represented": 0.5628005266189575, "Duplicate skipToken symbols: RTK skipToken imported in useFolder vs local skipToken Symbol exported from useAbilities can cause confusion and potential runtime bugs if wrong skipToken is passed across APIs": 0.2684720754623413, "useIsGrafanaPromRuleEditable returns non-editable early when folderUid is missing instead of throwing an error like useIsRuleEditable does, creating behavioral divergence for the same concept": 0.2099907398223877, "getEditableIdentifier may return undefined causing RuleActionsButtons.V2 to return null and silently hide action buttons without clear indication to users": 0.3447589874267578, "Missing/empty folderUid silently marks Grafana prom rules non-editable instead of surfacing the invalid state as a data integrity error": 0.32762670516967773}